{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And I will pass through the land of Egypt.</b> For the power of HaShem and His mighty acts are what pass, as though HaShem passes:" "<b>And against all the gods of Egypt I will execute judgments.</b> Like the manner of and the head of Dagon fell before him to the ground (I Samuel 5:4), and likewise it is written, and YHWH executed judgments on their gods (Numbers 33:4)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:33:30.678620252Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}